  "description": "Compare the original two-cell left shaded group with the four-cell right shaded group in one seven-part strip. Source: seven equal subdivisions, only the third cell blank. Regularization: straight lines and uniform neutral fill replace scan hatching; no labels or solved inequality are added.",
